---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import siteConfig from '@/site-config'
import TypedText from '@/components/TypedText.vue'

const funFacts = [
  'X++ by day, feeding my curiosity by night',
  'one flake to rule them all',
  'light captured, frozen in time',
]
---

<BaseLayout description={siteConfig.description}>
  <article class="prose lg:prose-xl">
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
      Greetings! My name is
      <b>Hidayat Taufiqur</b>
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4 text-md">
      <TypedText
        client:load
        messages={funFacts}
        type-speed={55}
        delete-speed={28}
        pause-time={1500}
        between-pause={2000}
        aria-label="Fun facts about me"
      />
    </p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg">
      I am a backend engineer by training and a <b>D365FO</b> developer by circumstance. Three phases, roughly.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
      <b>Now.</b>
      <b>Associate Technical Developer</b> at <b>9 Dots Consulting</b>. I started there never having opened an ERP, so
      most of the job is reading the standard application until a process finally makes sense. My favourite hunt was a
      Power BI refresh that kept timing out. Nothing in the report pointed anywhere useful. The cause was an unused
      tax-calculation side effect sitting inside the standard exchange-rate call, costing everyone time the whole while.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
      <b>Before that,</b> I was a backend engineer at <b>Telkom Indonesia</b>, writing internal APIs in <b>Go</b> and
      <b>TypeScript</b> and their documentation. Moving data between systems and keeping them consistent and robust. That
      included a database migration and a <b>Camunda</b> workflow layer that started as my apprenticeship capstone.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
      Around that I took a freelance year building an <b>ontology generation system</b>: a Flask backend that uses
      LangChain and OpenAI to draft competency questions, which is the slow, expert-heavy part of ontology work.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
      <b>And college.</b>
      <b>Telkom University</b>, Informatics. I spent three semesters as a practicum assistant teaching data structures
      and algorithms to over <b>250 students</b>, most of whom were meeting the material for the first time. I was in
      the Computing Lab, the Google Developer Student Club, and <b>Proclub</b>, which I joined as a member and left as
      president. My thesis measured HTTP versions against backend application performance.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
      The side project I keep coming back to is <b>FnO Navigator</b>, a map of the D365FO table graph, because the
      database is thousands of tables deep and Microsoft does not ship a compass.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
      Off the clock I have supported <b>Chelsea</b> since I was five, which I chose because my older brother already did and
      I liked the colour. That decision has survived every football game since: Winning Eleven, PES, FIFA, now EA FC, on whatever
      console or PC I happened to own.
    </p>

    <ul class="not-prose mt-4 space-y-2 text-lg">
      <li>
        <b>Music</b>: what I listen to oftentimes portrays how I feel in that moment. Or maybe what I want to feel at
        that time. I listen to most genres, but of course some more than the others.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Films</b>: I rewatch the ones that mean something to me more often than I chase new ones.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Guitar</b>: I have owned one for years and still cannot play it properly.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Games</b>: a Valorant queue when friends are online, and a Mobile Legends jungle I take far more seriously
        than the game deserves.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="not-prose mt-10">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3">Experience</h3>
      <dl class="space-y-2 text-sm text-main">
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <dt class="shrink-0 w-48 font-semibold">9 Dots Consulting</dt>
          <dd class="opacity-70">Associate Technical Developer · 2025–present</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <dt class="shrink-0 w-48 font-semibold">Nusantara Food Ontology</dt>
          <dd class="opacity-70">Backend Developer (Freelance) · 2024–2025</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <dt class="shrink-0 w-48 font-semibold">Telkom Indonesia</dt>
          <dd class="opacity-70">Backend Developer Intern · 2023–2024</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <dt class="shrink-0 w-48 font-semibold">Telkom Indonesia</dt>
          <dd class="opacity-70">Backend Stream (DBT Program) · 2023</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <dt class="shrink-0 w-48 font-semibold">Informatics Laboratory</dt>
          <dd class="opacity-70">Practicum Assistant · 2022–2023</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <dt class="shrink-0 w-48 font-semibold">Proclub Telkom University</dt>
          <dd class="opacity-70">President (2023–2024) · Lead Software Engineer (2022–2023)</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="not-prose mt-8">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3">Education</h3>
      <dl class="space-y-1 text-sm text-main">
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <dt class="shrink-0 w-48 font-semibold">Telkom University</dt>
          <dd class="opacity-70">S.Kom. Informatics · GPA 3.76/4.00 Cum Laude · 2020–2024</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="not-prose mt-8">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3">Toolbox</h3>
      <dl class="space-y-2 text-sm text-main">
        <div class="flex gap-2">
          <dt class="font-semibold shrink-0 w-40">Languages</dt>
          <dd>TypeScript, JavaScript, Go, Python, Java, C/C++, Bash, X++</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-2">
          <dt class="font-semibold shrink-0 w-40">Frameworks</dt>
          <dd>Node.js, Express, Laravel, Flask, React, React Native, LangChain</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-2">
          <dt class="font-semibold shrink-0 w-40">Databases</dt>
          <dd>PostgreSQL, MySQL, Microsoft SQL Server, MongoDB, Redis</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-2">
          <dt class="font-semibold shrink-0 w-40">Cloud &amp; DevOps</dt>
          <dd>
            GCP, Hyperledger Fabric, Docker, <a
              href="https://github.com/hidayattaufiqur/nix-config"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="prose-link">Nix</a
            >, GitHub Actions, Azure DevOps
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-2">
          <dt class="font-semibold shrink-0 w-40">Monitoring &amp; Servers</dt>
          <dd>Prometheus, Grafana, Nginx</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-2">
          <dt class="font-semibold shrink-0 w-40">Specialized</dt>
          <dd>
            D365FO, SSRS, LCS, Linux, <a
              href="https://github.com/hidayattaufiqur/cracked.nvchad"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="prose-link">Neovim</a
            >, Postman, Notion, AI/Agents
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="not-prose mt-8">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3">Machines</h3>
      <dl class="space-y-2 text-sm text-main">
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <dt class="shrink-0 w-48 font-semibold">Desktop</dt>
          <dd class="opacity-70">Ryzen 5 5600G · RX 6600 · 16GB RAM · 1TB · NixOS + Windows (dual boot)</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <dt class="shrink-0 w-48 font-semibold">Personal laptop</dt>
          <dd class="opacity-70">Acer Swift 3 · i5-1135G7 · 16GB RAM · 512GB · NixOS</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <dt class="shrink-0 w-48 font-semibold">Work laptop</dt>
          <dd class="opacity-70">ThinkPad E14 Gen 6 · Core Ultra 7 155U · 32GB RAM · 1TB · Windows</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <dt class="shrink-0 w-48 font-semibold">VPS</dt>
          <dd class="opacity-70">4 vCPU · 8GB RAM · 160GB · NixOS</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Photography</h3>
      <p class="text-lg">
        Photography stuck, mostly for the part after the shutter, when the image is still unfinished and the choices are
        mine. A selection lives
        <a href="/photography" aria-label="See my photography gallery" class="prose-link">here</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <p class="text-lg mt-6">
      The full timeline is in my
      <b><a href="/resume.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="View my CV/resume" class="prose-link">CV/resume</a></b>.
    </p>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <p class="text-lg">Elsewhere on the internet:</p>
      <div class="flex gap-x-4 gap-y-2 flex-wrap mt-4">
        {
          siteConfig.socialLinks.map((link) => (
            <a
              aria-label={link.text}
              href={link.href}
              target="_blank"
              class="prose-link text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors duration-200 flex items-center p-2 rounded hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700"
            >
              <i class:list={[link.icon]} class="text-xl mr-2" />
              {link.text}
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg">
        Email me at
        <a
          class="text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors duration-200"
          aria-label={siteConfig.email}
          href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}
        >
          {siteConfig.email}
        </a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
